    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309653
    m_Localized: 'Trainer adds a racing line (green: fast, yellow: brake, red: slow) and an arrow to the next gate. Ghost lanes: fly through the lane posts.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309654
    m_Localized: Crash speed
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309655
    m_Localized: m/s
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309656
    m_Localized: Air drag
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309657
    m_Localized: Motor lag
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309658
    m_Localized: Battery sag
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309659
    m_Localized: Lower drag = floatier and faster. Higher motor lag = softer, slower throttle response.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309660
    m_Localized: Callsign
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309661
    m_Localized: Shown on the leaderboard and to other pilots online.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309662
    m_Localized: Post lap times online
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309663
    m_Localized: 'On: the best lap of each finished race on a built-in track goes to its online leaderboard (signs in anonymously).'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309664
    m_Localized: Open Field
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309665
    m_Localized: Big outdoor loop with a floating gate and a hurdle. Room to learn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309666
    m_Localized: Hangar 7
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309667
    m_Localized: 'Indoor hall: tight turns between crates, columns and walls. Whoop heaven.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309668
    m_Localized: Dockyard
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309669
    m_Localized: Container corridors and a gate above a container stack.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309670
    m_Localized: Spline Test Loop
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309671
    m_Localized: Figure-eight lane track with an overpass (spline track system test).
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309672
    m_Localized: Stadium Oval
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309673
    m_Localized: 'Floodlit football stadium: an easy oval around the pitch. Learn the lanes and gates.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309674
    m_Localized: Serpent Arena
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309675
    m_Localized: 'The stadium race track: loops round the landing pads, a figure-eight at the centre spot and four overpasses.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309676
    m_Localized: 5" Race
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309677
    m_Localized: 5" Freestyle
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309678
    m_Localized: 65mm Whoop
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309679
    m_Localized: 3" Toothpick
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309680
    m_Localized: 3.5" Cinewhoop
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309681
    m_Localized: 65 mm Whoop
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309682
    m_Localized: 7" Long Range
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309683
    m_Localized: My quad
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309684
    m_Localized: '650 g, ~10:1 thrust-to-weight. Light, fast and twitchy: the race class.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309685
    m_Localized: 750 g with an action cam, ~7.5:1. More momentum, smoother, Actual rates.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309686
    m_Localized: '32 g ducted tiny whoop, ~3:1. Slow, floaty and forgiving: great indoors and for learning.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309687
    m_Localized: Calibrate
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309688
    m_Localized: Use preset
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309689
    m_Localized: 'Calibration cleared: using the preset / default mapping.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309690
    m_Localized: 'Reader: {0}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309691
    m_Localized: Auto
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309692
    m_Localized: Connection help
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309693
    m_Localized: See {0}.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309694
    m_Localized: No radio found.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309695
    m_Localized: Plug it in with USB (joystick / HID mode) or pair it over Bluetooth in Windows settings.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309696
    m_Localized: Power the radio on, plug it into the PC by USB and pick {0}.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309697
    m_Localized: '{0} detected in Xbox mode: it flies as a gamepad with radio-style throttle.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309698
    m_Localized: via {0}, {1} channels
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309699
    m_Localized: 'Preset: {0}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309700
    m_Localized: (verified)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309701
    m_Localized: (not yet verified on hardware)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309702
    m_Localized: none (generic AETR guess)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309703
    m_Localized: 'Mapping: {0}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309704
    m_Localized: your calibration
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309705
    m_Localized: preset/default. Calibrate for best results
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309706
    m_Localized: Connect a radio first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309707
    m_Localized: BetaFPV radio (generic)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309708
    m_Localized: EdgeTX / OpenTX radio (generic)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309709
    m_Localized: BetaFPV LiteRadio 2 SIM (joystick mode)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309710
    m_Localized: BetaFPV LiteRadio 2 SIM (Xbox mode)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309711
    m_Localized: RadioMaster Pocket (EdgeTX USB joystick)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309712
    m_Localized: Calibrate radio
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309713
    m_Localized: Cancel
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309714
    m_Localized: Skip
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309715
    m_Localized: Next
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309716
    m_Localized: Step {0}/{1}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309717
    m_Localized: 'Move BOTH sticks to every corner a few times. ({0}/4 axes found)

      Don''t touch the switches.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309718
    m_Localized: Now let both sticks centre, THROTTLE DOWN, and hold still...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309719
    m_Localized: Push THROTTLE fully UP and hold.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309720
    m_Localized: Throttle back down. Push YAW fully RIGHT and hold.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309721
    m_Localized: Centre yaw. Push PITCH fully FORWARD (nose down) and hold.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309722
    m_Localized: Centre pitch. Push ROLL fully RIGHT and hold.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309723
    m_Localized: 'Centre the sticks. Flip your ARM switch to ARMED and hold.

      (Skip if you want to arm with throttle low instead.)'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309724
    m_Localized: 'Put the MODE switch in ACRO, then move it to ANGLE and hold.

      (Skip if you don''t use a mode switch.)'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309725
    m_Localized: 'If the mode switch has a third position, move it to HORIZON and hold.

      (Skips by itself after a few seconds.)'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309726
    m_Localized: 'Optional: flip the switch (or press the button) you want for CAMERA VIEW and hold.

      (Skip if you don''t want one.)'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309727
    m_Localized: Done! Flip the arm switch off.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309728
    m_Localized: Cancelled.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309729
    m_Localized: 'Calibration incomplete: not all four stick axes were found. Try again.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309730
    m_Localized: Calibration saved ({0}). Throttle ch{1}, yaw ch{2}, pitch ch{3}, roll ch{4}{5}.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309731
    m_Localized: ', arm ch{0}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309732
    m_Localized: ', arm with throttle low'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309733
    m_Localized: ', view ch{0}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309734
    m_Localized: Connecting a radio
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309735
    m_Localized: '<b>RadioMaster Pocket / EdgeTX radios (PC):</b> power the radio <b>on</b>, plug in USB and pick <b>USB Joystick (HID)</b>. No driver is needed. If Windows shows "STM32 BOOTLOADER", the radio is in firmware mode: unplug it and power it on normally first. In the model''s mixes, put SA on CH5 (arm) and SB on CH6 (flight mode).'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309736
    m_Localized: <b>LiteRadio 2 SE / LiteRadio 3 (USB-C):</b> power the radio on in <b>joystick (HID) mode</b> and plug it into the PC. If the sticks don't move in {0}, enable joystick compatibility in <b>BETAFPV Configurator</b>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309737
    m_Localized: <b>LiteRadio 2 SIM:</b> joystick mode (default) shows up as "BETAFPV Joystick". In Xbox mode it works as a gamepad; throttle is then full-range, like a radio.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309738
    m_Localized: <b>LiteRadio 4 / 4 SE (ELRS):</b> USB-C, or <b>Bluetooth joystick mode</b> paired in <b>Windows Settings > Bluetooth & devices</b>. Over USB-C, joystick mode only works with the radio <b>switched off</b> and powered by the cable.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2872970309739
    m_Localized: <b>Then:</b> Menu > {0} > <b>{1}</b>. Arm with your arm switch (throttle low). The calibration can also assign a <b>camera view</b> switch. If some sticks or switches don't move in {0}, check {2}.
